diff --git a/IOS_BUILD_NOTES.md b/IOS_BUILD_NOTES.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..37410a0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/IOS_BUILD_NOTES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# iOS build preparation
+
+This branch is a first attempt to build an unsigned iOS IPA from the public Orbit sources. It has **not** passed an Xcode build or a device test.
+
+## Changes
+
+- Replaced missing image imports with images already in the repository.
+- Restored a missing album play button and repaired three broken component export paths.
+- Added empty optional API configuration so Metro can resolve imports without embedding private credentials. Spotify playlist import, PodcastIndex API, and Last.fm integration need their own authorized backend/credentials to function. Never put a Spotify client secret in a mobile bundle.
+- Added iOS background audio and Files app document sharing declarations.
+- Added `.github/workflows/ios-unsigned.yml` to compile on a macOS GitHub runner and upload an unsigned IPA artifact. An IPA from this workflow needs signing with an appropriate certificate before installation.
+
+## Status
+
+`npm ci --ignore-scripts` and `npx react-native bundle --platform ios --dev false --entry-file index.js` passed on Linux. The native iOS build and runtime have not been checked; remaining Android-specific features may need porting or disabling. The repository's iOS app icon set has no icon image files. Optional integrations without API credentials will not work.
+
+The workflow runs on pushes to branch `ios-ipa`, or by manual dispatch in GitHub Actions. A failed job should be diagnosed from its macOS build log before promising an installable app.
